[22.454146, "o", "├ \u001b(B\u001b[mif isMissing \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31mnot_found !\u001b[13;8H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m\u001b[1K ├ \u001b(B\u001b[mif canRetry \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36mconnecting\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · wait\u001b[14;8H\u001b[1K └ \u001b(B\u001b[motherwise \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31mfailed !\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m  \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35mreceiving\u001b[17;7H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mcomplete \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36mverifying\r\u001b[19d"]
[22.454163, "o", "  \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35mverifying\u001b[20;7H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[msum_matches \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36msaved\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · move_into_place\u001b[21;7H"]
[22.454196, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[msum_differs \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31mfailed !\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · delete_partial_file\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m  \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35msaved\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · end · goal\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m  \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31mnot_found\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · end\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31m · needs attention\r\u001b[27d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m  \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31mfailed\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · end\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31m · needs attention\r\u001b[28d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m↑↓ scroll   space page   a all routes   esc back   ? how to read   q quit   56%\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[25.706567, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mHow to read this\r\u001b[3d"]
[25.706582, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mA program is shown as the situations it can be in. Each one is called a state.\r\u001b[4d"]
[25.706611, "o", "Under a state are the things that can happen there, and where each one leads.\r\u001b[6d"]
[25.706645, "o", "\u001b[36m▶ \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35midle\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · start\u001b[20X\u001b[6;35Hthe state the program starts in\u001b[7;7H"]
[25.706687, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mstart \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36mchecking\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m            when \"start\" happens it moves to \"checking\"\u001b[8;7H\u001b(B\u001b[merror\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m\u001b[23X\u001b[8;35Hone thing that can happen, with several outcomes:\u001b[9;8H\u001b[1K "]
[25.70674, "o", "├ \u001b(B\u001b[mif is_auth \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31mauth !\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m     the first line whose \"if\" is true wins\u001b[10;8H\u001b[1K └ \u001b(B\u001b[motherwise \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[31mfailed !\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m    and this one when none is\u001b[11;3H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35mok\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · end\u001b[24X\u001b[11;35H"]
[25.706765, "o", "a state where the program stops\r\u001b[13d\u001b(B\u001b[m! and red mark a state that needs attention, usually a failure.\r\u001b[15d"]
[25.70683, "o", "Below the states there are lists:\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m  Ways it goes wrong   \u001b(B\u001b[mevery move into a state that needs attention\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m  Routes\u001b[15X\u001b[17;24H\u001b(B\u001b[mevery way from the start to an end\r\u001b[18d"]
[25.706839, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m  Goes back            \u001b(B\u001b[mevery move that returns to an earlier state, such as a retry\r\u001b[19d"]
[25.706883, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m  Conditions           \u001b(B\u001b[mwhat each \"if\" means, in the words written in the program\r\u001b[21d"]
[25.706926, "o", "shape changes no program. It runs only the commands in shape.json that print each table.\r\u001b[28d\u001b(B\u001b[0;2many key goes back   q quit\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[29.763404, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mdownload.fetch\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m   download/download.js\r\u001b[2d"]
[29.763409, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mFetches one file: connects, receives it, checks it and saves it.\r\u001b[3d"]
[29.763419, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m7 states, 8 transitions, 4 routes to an end, 3 ways it goes wrong\r\u001b[4d! marks a state that needs attention\r\u001b[6d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m▶ \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35midle\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m · start\u001b[7;7H"]
[29.763436, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mrequested \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36mconnecting\r\u001b[9d  \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35mconnecting\u001b[10;7H"]
[29.763437, "o", "\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mconnected \u001b(B\u001b[0;2m→ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36mreceiving\u001b[11;7H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[merror\u001b[12;8H"]
